      "title": "What this node gives you",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Load Premiere Timeline\n\nHands you the whole edit as a list of segments -- one per clip, in the order they play, across every video track.\n\n**skip_disabled** is on, so muted and disabled clips are left out. Turn it off and the sample gains a fourth segment: a take the editor had switched off.\n\n**summary** is the readable version of that same list. Wire it into a text preview any time you want to see what you actually loaded.\n\nThe **Browse...** bar lists files on the machine running ComfyUI. If you are viewing ComfyUI from a different machine the button is hidden and the bar reads *Host machine only* -- type the path into `file_path` by hand instead, naming the file as that machine sees it."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
