      "title": "Picking one out",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## One segment at a time\n\n**Get Premiere Segment** pulls a single segment out by number. `index` is `0` here -- the first clip. Change it to `1` or `2` and Run again.\n\nYou get nine things back about that segment: its source file, where the clip starts and how long it runs, its frame count, its frame rate, its name, and its pixel size. Only `path` is wired up in this demo; drag out from any of the others when you need them.\n\nAsk for a segment that isn't there and the node says so plainly instead of guessing."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
